name: ['A-Geological Appraiser', 'Abrade', "Abuelo's Awakening", 'Abuelo, Ancestral Echo', 'Abyssal Gorestalker', 'Aclazotz, Deepest Betrayal // Temple of the Dead', 'Acolyte of Aclazotz', 'Acrobatic Leap', 'Adaptive Gemguard', 'Akal Pakal, First Among Equals', 'Akawalli, the Seething Tower', 'Amalia Benavides Aguirre', "Ancestors' Aid", 'Ancestral Reminiscence', 'Anim Pakal, Thousandth Moon', 'Another Chance', 'Armored Kincaller', 'Attentive Sunscribe', 'Bartolomé del Presidio', 'Basking Capybara', 'Bat Colony', 'Bedrock Tortoise', 'Belligerent Yearling', 'Bitter Triumph', 'Bloodletter of Aclazotz', 'Bloodthorn Flail', 'Bonehoard Dracosaur', 'Brackish Blunder', 'Braided Net // Braided Quipu', "Brass's Tunnel-Grinder // Tecutlan, the Searing Rift", 'Brazen Blademaster', 'Breeches, Eager Pillager', 'Bringer of the Last Gift', 'Broodrage Mycoid', 'Buried Treasure', 'Burning Sun Cavalry', 'Calamitous Cave-In', 'Canonized in Blood', 'Caparocti Sunborn', 'Captain Storm, Cosmium Raider', 'Captivating Cave', 'Careening Mine Cart', "Cartographer's Companion", 'Cavern Stomper', 'Cavern of Souls', 'Cavernous Maw', 'Cenote Scout', 'Chart a Course', 'Child of the Volcano', 'Chimil, the Inner Sun', 'Chupacabra Echo', 'Clay-Fired Bricks // Cosmium Kiln', 'Coati Scavenger', 'Cogwork Wrestler', 'Colossadactyl', 'Compass Gnome', 'Confounding Riddle', 'Contested Game Ball', 'Corpses of the Lost', 'Cosmium Blast', 'Cosmium Confluence', 'Council of Echoes', "Curator of Sun's Creation", 'Daring Discovery', 'Dauntless Dismantler', 'Dead Weight', 'Deathcap Marionette', 'Deconstruction Hammer', 'Deep Goblin Skulltaker', 'Deep-Cavern Bat', 'Deepfathom Echo', 'Deeproot Pilgrimage', 'Defossilize', 'Diamond Pick-Axe', 'Didact Echo', 'Digsite Conservator', 'Dinotomaton', 'Dire Flail // Dire Blunderbuss', 'Disruptor Wanderglyph', 'Disturbed Slumber', 'Dowsing Device // Geode Grotto', "Dreadmaw's Ire", 'Dusk Rose Reliquary', 'Earthshaker Dreadmaw', 'Eaten by Piranhas', 'Echo of Dusk', 'Echoing Deeps', 'Enterprising Scallywag', 'Envoy of Okinec Ahau', "Etali's Favor", "Explorer's Cache", 'Fabrication Foundry', 'Family Reunion', 'Fanatical Offering', 'Forest', 'Forgotten Monument', 'Frilled Cave-Wurm', 'Fungal Fortitude', 'Gargantuan Leech', 'Geological Appraiser', 'Get Lost', 'Ghalta, Stampede Tyrant', "Gishath, Sun's Avatar", 'Glimpse the Core', 'Glorifier of Suffering', 'Glowcap Lantern', 'Goblin Tomb Raider', 'Goldfury Strider', "Grasping Shadows // Shadows' Lair", 'Greedy Freebooter', 'Growing Rites of Itlimoc // Itlimoc, Cradle of the Sun', 'Guardian of the Great Door', 'Helping Hand', 'Hermitic Nautilus', 'Hidden Cataract', 'Hidden Courtyard', 'Hidden Necropolis', 'Hidden Nursery', 'Hidden Volcano', 'Hit the Mother Lode', 'Hotfoot Gnome', 'Hoverstone Pilgrim', "Huatli's Final Strike", 'Huatli, Poet of Unity // Roar of the Fifth People', 'Hulking Raptor', "Hunter's Blowgun", 'Hurl into History', "Idol of the Deep King // Sovereign's Macuahuitl", 'In the Presence of Ages', 'Inti, Seneschal of the Sun', 'Intrepid Paleontologist', 'Inverted Iceberg // Iceberg Titan', 'Ironpaw Aspirant', 'Island', 'Itzquinth, Firstborn of Gishath', "Ixalli's Lorekeeper", 'Jade Seedstones // Jadeheart Attendant', 'Jadelight Spelunker', 'Join the Dead', "Kaslem's Stonetree // Kaslem's Strider", 'Kellan, Daring Traveler // Journey On', "Kinjalli's Dawnrunner", 'Kitesail Larcenist', "Kutzil's Flanker", 'Kutzil, Malamet Exemplar', 'Lodestone Needle // Guidestone Compass', 'Magmatic Galleon', 'Malamet Battle Glyph', 'Malamet Brawler', 'Malamet Scythe', 'Malamet Veteran', 'Malamet War Scribe', 'Malcolm, Alluring Scoundrel', 'Malicious Eclipse', 'Marauding Brinefang', 'Market Gnome', "Master's Guide-Mural // Master's Manufactory", 'Matzalantli, the Great Door // The Core', 'Mephitic Draught', 'Merfolk Cave-Diver', 'Might of the Ancestors', "Miner's Guidewing", 'Mineshaft Spider', 'Mischievous Pup', 'Molten Collapse', 'Mountain', 'Nicanzil, Current Conductor', 'Nurturing Bristleback', 'Oaken Siren', 'Ojer Axonil, Deepest Might // Temple of Power', 'Ojer Kaslem, Deepest Growth // Temple of Cultivation', 'Ojer Pakpatiq, Deepest Epoch // Temple of Cyclical Time', 'Ojer Taq, Deepest Foundation // Temple of Civilization', 'Oltec Archaeologists', 'Oltec Cloud Guard', 'Orazca Puzzle-Door', 'Oteclan Landmark // Oteclan Levitator', 'Out of Air', 'Over the Edge', "Palani's Hatcher", 'Panicked Altisaur', 'Pathfinding Axejaw', 'Petrify', 'Pirate Hat', 'Pit of Offerings', 'Plains', 'Plundering Pirate', 'Poetic Ingenuity', 'Poison Dart Frog', 'Preacher of the Schism', 'Primordial Gnawer', 'Promising Vein', 'Pugnacious Hammerskull', "Queen's Bay Paladin", 'Quicksand Whirlpool', 'Quintorius Kand', 'Rampaging Ceratops', 'Rampaging Spiketail', 'Ray of Ruin', "Relic's Roar", 'Resplendent Angel', 'Restless Anchorage', 'Restless Prairie', 'Restless Reef', 'Restless Ridgeline', 'Restless Vents', 'River Herald Guide', 'River Herald Scout', 'Roaming Throne', 'Ruin-Lurker Bat', 'Rumbling Rockslide', 'Runaway Boulder', 'Sage of Days', "Saheeli's Lattice // Mastercraft Raptor", "Saheeli, the Sun's Brilliance", 'Sanguine Evangelist', 'Scampering Surveyor', 'Screaming Phantom', 'Scytheclaw Raptor', 'Seeker of Sunlight', 'Seismic Monstrosaur', 'Self-Reflection', 'Sentinel of the Nameless City', 'Shipwreck Sentry', 'Sinuous Benthisaur', 'Skullcap Snail', 'Soaring Sandwing', 'Song of Stupefaction', 'Sorcerous Spyglass', 'Soulcoil Viper', 'Souls of the Lost', 'Sovereign Okinec Ahau', 'Spelunking', 'Spring-Loaded Sawblades // Bladewheel Chariot', 'Spyglass Siren', 'Squirming Emergence', 'Staggering Size', 'Stalactite Stalker', 'Starving Revenant', 'Staunch Crewmate', 'Stinging Cave Crawler', 'Subterranean Schooner', 'Sunbird Standard // Sunbird Effigy', 'Sunfire Torch', 'Sunken Citadel', 'Sunshot Militia', 'Swamp', "Swashbuckler's Whip", 'Synapse Necromage', "Tarrian's Journal // The Tomb of Aclazotz", "Tarrian's Soulcleaver", 'Tectonic Hazard', 'Tendril of the Mycotyrant', 'T